// WHY: Grafana Alloy (Agent successor) scrapes Node Exporter and remote_writes
// to Grafana Cloud Free Tier. App traces/metrics go OTLP from ASP.NET; Alloy
// covers the *host* so you get infra + app in one Grafana stack.

prometheus.scrape "node_exporter" {
  targets = [{
    "__address__" = "127.0.0.1:9100",
  }]
  forward_to = [prometheus.remote_write.grafana_cloud.receiver]
  scrape_interval = "60s"
  // WHY: 60s keeps Free Tier series/samples low on a single EC2.
}

prometheus.remote_write "grafana_cloud" {
  endpoint {
    url = "{{ grafana_prometheus_url }}"
    basic_auth {
      username = "{{ grafana_instance_id }}"
      password = "{{ grafana_api_key }}"
    }
  }
}
